## Why This Is Asked
This DR scenario tests cross-region failure handling and automation across managed services in GCP. It evaluates the candidate's ability to pick services, set SLAs, and design reliable rollback.

## Key Concepts
- Cross-region replication and failover for Cloud SQL
- DNS-based traffic shifting and global load balancing
- IAM least-privilege and automation safety
- Observability, drills, and cost considerations

## Code Example
```javascript
// Pseudocode for triggering DR
function failover() {
  promoteReplica('us-east1');
  updateDNS('new-primary.example.com');
  rerouteTraffic();
}
```

